+
+**Timing, fat against fat** (`landed/timing.txt`, `landed/timing.summary.txt`):
+card free, host load 2-5, four rotated rounds, relations identical in all
+108 runs. base = HEAD (`47f20cc2`), new = `b7d0608f`:
